library "Foreign".
terminology "Answers":
- system is `urn:retention:answers`.
- code is `yes` display is `Yes`.
- code is `no` display is `No`.
- code is `uncertain` display is `Uncertain`.
terminology "Uncertain":
- system is `urn:retention:answers`.
- code is `uncertain`.
concept "A":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is CodeableConcept.
- code is `a`.
- value domain is answer options.
- value from is "Answers":
  - not qualifying is `no`.
- shape reduction is most recent.
presentation for "A": - question text is "A?".
concept "B":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is CodeableConcept.
- code is `b`.
- value domain is answer options.
- value from is "Answers":
  - not qualifying is `no`.
- shape reduction is most recent.
presentation for "B": - question text is "B?".
concept "Flagged":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- definition is any available value of "A" and "B" in "Uncertain" using validity of "A".
- shape reduction is most recent.
